<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <%- include('../../../partials/platform/head.ejs', {
      title: "IT help: find out which tech expert you need | JobsDoor360",
      description: "Website broken or building something new? Answer four questions and find out exactly which kind of developer or expert to hire, before you spend anything.",
      canonical: "https://jobsdoor360.in/smart-decisions/it-help/",
    }) -%>
  </head>
  <body class="sd-body" data-ga-module="smart_it_help">
    <%- include('../../../partials/platform/navbar.ejs', { path: "/smart-decisions/it-help/" }) -%>
    <main id="main">
      <header class="sd-hero" data-ga-section="hero">
        <div class="sd-wrap">
          <nav class="sd-crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb" data-ga-section="breadcrumb"><a href="/" data-ga-event="nav_click" data-ga-name="breadcrumb_home">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/smart-decisions/" data-ga-event="nav_click" data-ga-name="breadcrumb_smart_decisions">Smart Decisions</a><span>/</span><span aria-current="page" style="opacity:1;margin:0">IT help</span></nav>
          <span class="sd-pill">FREE · 4 QUESTIONS · NO BIDDING WARS</span>
          <h1>Which tech expert do you actually need?</h1>
          <p>Something's wrong with your website, or you want to build something, and you don't know who to hire. Answer four quick questions and we'll tell you the kind of person you need.</p>
        </div>
      </header>
      <div class="sd-wrap sd-section">
        <section class="sd-panel" id="sd-quiz-card" data-ga-section="quiz">
          <div class="sd-progress" aria-hidden="true"><span id="sd-progress-bar"></span></div>
          <p class="sd-step" id="sd-step"></p>
          <h2 class="sd-q" id="sd-question" tabindex="-1">Loading…</h2>
          <div class="sd-options" id="sd-options" role="group" aria-labelledby="sd-question"></div>
          <div class="sd-btn-row">
            <button type="button" class="sd-btn sd-btn-ghost" id="sd-prev" style="visibility: hidden" data-ga-name="quiz_back">Back</button>
            <button type="button" class="sd-btn sd-btn-primary" id="sd-next" disabled data-ga-name="quiz_next">Next</button>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="sd-panel sd-hidden" id="sd-result-card" data-ga-section="result" aria-live="polite">
          <div class="sd-result-head">
            <span class="sd-badge">Here's your answer</span>
            <h2 class="sd-section-title" id="sd-result-title" tabindex="-1">Who to look for</h2>
            <p class="sd-section-sub">Now you know what to ask for instead of guessing.</p>
          </div>
          <div id="sd-recos"></div>
          <div class="sd-upsell" data-ga-section="upsell">
            <h3>Want us to find you a checked expert?</h3>
            <p>Pay a small flat fee, tell us the details once, and we'll match you with one or two verified experts who fit. No open bidding, no spam.</p>
            <div class="sd-price">₹50 flat</div>
            <a class="sd-btn sd-btn-green" href="/request-received/?for=it_expert_match" data-ga-event="upsell_click" data-ga-name="it_expert_match_cta" data-ga-product="it_expert_match" data-ga-price="50">Match me with an expert</a>
            <small>You only pay for the match. Hiring is still your call.</small>
          </div>
          <div class="sd-handoff" data-ga-section="next_step">Would you rather learn to do it yourself? <a href="/pricing/" data-ga-name="it_help_to_courses">See our programming courses →</a></div>
          <%# Sign-in prompt switched OFF: results pages no longer send people to
              the login page. To bring it back, move the block below out of this
              comment and uncomment the matching lines in the page's script.js.

          <div class="sd-handoff sd-hidden" id="sd-signin-hint" data-ga-section="signup_prompt">
            Save this so you don't have to explain it all again next time.
            <a id="sd-signin-link" href="/login/" data-ga-event="signup_prompt_click" data-ga-name="it_help_signup_prompt">Create a free profile →</a>
          </div>
          -%>
          <div class="sd-btn-row" style="justify-content: center">
            <button type="button" class="sd-btn sd-btn-ghost" id="sd-restart" data-ga-name="quiz_retake">Start over</button>
            <a class="sd-btn sd-btn-primary" href="/smart-decisions/" data-ga-name="see_all_smart_decisions">See all Smart Decisions</a>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </main>
    <%- include('../../../partials/platform/footer.ejs') -%>
    <script type="module" src="/staticfiles/db/dbconfig.js"></script>
    <script type="module" src="/staticfiles/mainfiles/smart-decisions/it-help/script.js?v=<%= platform_version %>"></script>
  </body>
</html>
